  "Prinsip ukhuwah Islamiyah.": "The principle of Islamic brotherhood (ukhuwah Islamiyah).",
  "Prinsip tolong-menolong dalam kebaikan.": "The principle of helping one another in what is good.",
  "Musyawarah dan mufakat.": "Musyawarah and consensus (mufakat).",
  "Amanah, kejujuran, keadilan, dan tanggung jawab.": "Trust (amanah), honesty, justice, and responsibility.",
  "Peraturan perundang-undangan yang berlaku.": "The laws and regulations in force.",
