  "Arah RKM: visi dan misi dari naskah dasar, serta maksud, tujuan, dan ruang lingkup kegiatan dari usulan Pak Badar.": "The direction of RKM: vision and mission from the base text, and purpose, aims, and scope of activities from Mr. Badar's proposal.",
  "Pasal 9": "Article 9",
  "Visi": "Vision",
  "Naskah dasar: AD/ART lama, AD Pasal 6 (disesuaikan untuk RKM)": "Base text: earlier AD/ART, AD Pasal 6 (adapted for RKM)",
  "Terwujudnya RKM Kampung Sukatani RW 03 sebagai wadah pelayanan sosial dan keagamaan masyarakat yang Murni dalam adab dan niat, Mandiri dalam ekonomi dan marwah, serta Tumbuh Berkelanjutan dalam membina generasi rabbani dan masyarakat madani. [belum dikonfirmasi: rumusan visi disesuaikan dari visi DKM: 'Masjid Nurul Falah Sukatani sebagai pusat peradaban umat' diganti 'RKM ... sebagai wadah pelayanan sosial dan keagamaan masyarakat' (frasa dari usulan Pak Badar, Pasal 7); perlu disetujui]": "RKM Kampung Sukatani RW 03 becomes a body for the community's social and religious service that is Pure in conduct and intention, Independent in livelihood and dignity, and Growing sustainably in nurturing a rabbani generation and a civil society. [belum dikonfirmasi: the vision wording was adapted from the DKM vision: 'Masjid Nurul Falah Sukatani as a centre of the community's civilization' was replaced with 'RKM ... as a body for the community's social and religious service' (a phrase from Mr. Badar's proposal, Pasal 7); this still needs approval]",
  "Pasal 10": "Article 10",
  "Misi": "Mission",
  "Naskah dasar: AD/ART lama, AD Pasal 7 (disesuaikan untuk RKM; misi Imarah dan Ri'ayah khusus masjid dihapus)": "Base text: earlier AD/ART, AD Pasal 7 (adapted for RKM; the mosque-specific Imarah and Ri'ayah missions were removed)",
  "Idarah (Tata Kelola & Administrasi): Menyelenggarakan manajemen organisasi, administrasi, dan keuangan RKM secara satu pintu, modern, transparan, dan akuntabel.": "Idarah (governance & administration): run RKM's management, administration, and finances through a single treasury, in a modern, transparent, and accountable way.",
  "Ijtima'iyah (Sosial & Pelayanan Kematian): Mengelola layanan fardhu kifayah pengurusan jenazah serta pengelolaan Taman Pemakaman Umum (TPU).": "Ijtima'iyah (social life & funeral care): manage fardhu kifayah funeral services and the public cemetery (TPU).",
  "Pengelolaan TPU ditambahkan dari usulan Pak Badar, Pasal 8 huruf d; UPZ dan Baitul Mal dihapus": "Management of the TPU was added from Mr. Badar's proposal, Pasal 8 huruf d; UPZ and Baitul Mal were removed",
  "Pasal 11": "Article 11",
  "Maksud": "Purpose",
  "Tambahan dari usulan Pak Badar (Pasal 7)": "Added from Mr. Badar's proposal (Pasal 7)",
  "RKM dibentuk sebagai wadah pelayanan sosial dan keagamaan masyarakat dalam membantu penyelenggaraan kewajiban terhadap warga yang meninggal dunia serta mengelola Taman Pemakaman Umum (TPU).": "RKM is formed as a body for the community's social and religious service, to help carry out the duty toward residents who have died and to manage the public cemetery (TPU).",
