  "Keluarga terlebih dahulu menghubungi perwakilan RKM di RT masing-masing (Seksi Penggalangan Dana, sesuai bagan struktur organisasi).": "The family first contacts the RKM representative in their RT (the Fundraising Section, according to the organizational chart).",
  "Perwakilan RT langsung menghubungi Seksi Pemakaman, Seksi Pengurusan Jenazah Perempuan (untuk jenazah perempuan), dan Koordinator Seksi Perlengkapan (Bpk. Dede Dzulkipli).": "The RT representative immediately contacts the Burial Section, the Women's Funeral Section (for a woman's body), and the Coordinator of the Equipment Section (Mr. Dede Dzulkipli).",
  "Jenazah perempuan dimandikan dan dikafani oleh Seksi Pengurusan Jenazah Perempuan, sedangkan jenazah laki-laki dimandikan dan dikafani oleh petugas laki-laki. Seksi Pemakaman menyiapkan liang lahat, dan Seksi Perlengkapan menyiapkan keranda serta perlengkapan.": "A woman's body is washed and shrouded by the Women's Funeral Section, while a man's body is washed and shrouded by male workers. The Burial Section prepares the grave, and the Equipment Section prepares the bier and the equipment.",
  "Pengurusan jenazah tetap menjadi kewajiban keluarga; RKM membantu dengan menyediakan perwakilan, yaitu ustadz atau warga setempat yang berkenan.": "Funeral care remains the family's duty; RKM helps by providing a representative, namely an ustadz or a local resident who is willing.",
  "Bagi anggota, santunan Rp 600.000 diserahkan kepada keluarga melalui perwakilan RT.": "For a member, the benefit of Rp 600.000 is handed to the family through the RT representative.",
